WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.357
Unit twenty. People Who Help Us!

2
00:00:04.307 --> 00:00:08.117
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:12.008
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.059 --> 00:00:16.000
Today we learn about People Who Help Us. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.695 --> 00:00:19.829
Doctor. Say it with me. Doctor!

6
00:00:23.328 --> 00:00:26.878
Nurse. Say it with me. Nurse!

7
00:00:30.379 --> 00:00:33.896
Teacher. Say it with me. Teacher!

8
00:00:37.399 --> 00:00:40.599
Parent. Say it with me. Parent!

9
00:00:44.088 --> 00:00:47.505
Police. Say it with me. Police!

10
00:00:51.012 --> 00:00:54.112
Help. Say it with me. Help!

11
00:00:57.611 --> 00:01:00.961
Trust. Say it with me. Trust!

12
00:01:04.466 --> 00:01:07.899
Safe. Say it with me. Safe!

13
00:01:11.399 --> 00:01:19.309
Many people help keep me safe and healthy. A doctor and a nurse help when I am sick. My parent, teacher, and the police help me when I need it.

14
00:01:19.359 --> 00:01:20.509
I can do that too!

15
00:01:21.834 --> 00:01:27.215
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.265 --> 00:01:28.415
Teacher!

17
00:01:29.356 --> 00:01:34.639
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:34.689 --> 00:01:35.839
Trust!

19
00:01:36.613 --> 00:01:42.730
Did you know? Doctors and nurses learn for many years so they can help keep people healthy!

20
00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:44.758
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.466 --> 00:01:53.032
Think and answer. Who can you ask for help at school?

22
00:01:53.082 --> 00:01:54.232
Great answer!

23
00:01:55.432 --> 00:02:00.344
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:00.394 --> 00:02:03.056
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

